#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:202
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D Graphs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a new 2D graph on &kalgebra;, what you have to do is to go to the "
"<guilabel>2D Graph</guilabel> tab and click in the <guilabel>Add</guilabel> "
"tab to add the new function. Then your focus will go to an input text box "
"where you can type your function."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to use a typical f(x) function it is not necessary to specify "
"it, but if you want a f(y) or a polar function, you will have to add y-> and "
"q-> as the bounded variables."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "sin(x)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>x²</para>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "y->sin(y)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "q->3*sin(7*q)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "t->vector{sin t, t**2}"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have entered the function click on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"button to display the graph in the main window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Foncions"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can set several graphs on the same view. Just use the <guilabel>Add</"
"guilabel> button when you are in List mode. You can set each graph its own "
"color."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The view can be zoomed and moved with the mouse. Using the wheel you can "
"zoom in and out. You can also select an area with the left button of the "
"mouse and this area will be zoomed in. Move the view with the arrow keys."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>List</guilabel> tab, you can open a context menu with a "
"&RMB; click on a function and hide or remove it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "In the <guimenu>2D Graph</guimenu> menu you find these options:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show or hide the grid"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keep the aspect ratio while zooming"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Zoom in (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>+</keycap></keycombo>) "
"and zoom out (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>-</keycap></"
"keycombo>)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243 index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Save (<keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; <keycap>S</keycap></keycombo>) the "
"graph as image file"
msgstr ""

